iled only when fraud is confirmed or strongly suspected and exposure exceeds $1,000, the activity connects to a shared device, region or another customer's fraud, or the pattern is coordinated or undocumented.","source":"document","ref":"document:fraud-policy#\u00a73a","entity_ids":[]},{"claim":"Policy R9: Undocumented coordinated abuse: CREATE_CASE, FILE_REPORT, ESCALATE_TO_ANALYST, and describe the pattern in your own words.","source":"document","ref":"document:fraud-policy#R9","entity_ids":[]}],"similar_prior_cases":["CC-3841","CC-4124","CC-3907"],"summary":"Undocumented on card C07297-K1: 4 transaction(s) from 2016-11-21 to 2016-11-21 totalling $1,906.07, probability 0.99.","written_to_graph":true,"graph_case_id":"ASSAY-HHG-006"},"evidence_requests":[],"next_best_actions":{"initial":[{"action":"BLOCK_CARD","route":"L1","reason":"R2: the cardholder denies the transaction, so the card is compromised."},{"action":"CREATE_CASE","route":"auto","reason":"R2: a denial requires an internal case with the evidence attached."},{"action":"FILE_REPORT","route":"L2","reason":"Policy \u00a73a: fraud is suspected and exposure $1,906.07 exceeds $1,000; the pattern is coordinated or undocumented (R9)."},{"action":"ESCALATE_TO_ANALYST","route":"auto","reason":"R9: a human analyst reviews the pattern description rather than forcing it into a known category."}],"final":[{"action":"BLOCK_CARD","route":"L1","reason":"R2: the cardholder denies the transaction, so the card is compromised."},{"action":"CREATE_CASE","route":"auto","reason":"R2: a denial requires an internal case with the evidence attached."},{"action":"FILE_REPORT","route":"L2","reason":"Policy \u00a73a: fraud is suspected and exposure $1,906.07 exceeds $1,000; the pattern is coordinated or undocumented (R9)."},{"action":"ESCALATE_TO_ANALYST","route":"auto","reason":"R9: a human analyst reviews the pattern description rather than forcing it into a known category."}],"what_changed":"nothing"},"sar":{"file":true,"reason":"Policy \u00a73a: fraud is suspected and exposure $1,906.07 exceeds $1,000; the pattern is coordinated or undocumented (R9).","narrative":"Between 2016-11-21 and 2016-11-21, card C07297-K1 held by customer C07297 was used for 4 transaction(s) totalling $1,906.07 that the bank has determined were not authorised by the cardholder (transaction IDs 3476602, 3476633, 3476665, 3476682). The activity was online, from device profile(s) Trident/7.0 | Windows 7 | ie 11.0 for desktop | 1920x1080; iOS Device | iOS 11.2.1 | mobile safari 11.0 | 2208x1242, billed to region code(s) 264, 476. The alert was raised on 2016-11-22 02:30:00 by customer report on transaction 3476682 ($482.12). The purchases were placed minutes apart with each amount just below $500, consistent with deliberately keeping each authorization under a review threshold; the bank has seen the identical shape on five other cardholders, all confirmed fraud. The cardholder disputed the activity. The card has been blocked pending reissue; this report is filed because fraud is suspected and exposure $1,906.07 exceeds $1,000; the pattern is coordinated or undocumented (R9).","subjects":["C07297","C07297-K1","Trident/7.0 | Windows 7 | ie 11.0 for desktop | 1920x1080","iOS Device | iOS 11.2.1 | mobile safari 11.0 | 2208x1242"],"total_amount_usd":1906.07,"activity_dates":["2016-11-21","2016-11-21"]},"stop_reason":"Policy \u00a76: the customer denies the transaction, which settles the question. No further evidence would change the decision.","tool_calls":8,"tokens":0,"latency_s":0.04},"kind":"exam"}